{
  "file_id": "ID03549",
  "text_count": 209,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We should keep looking for Taichi\nand Agumon until we find them.",
      "_offset": 619,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "There's no point. It's been a\nmonth, and we still have no idea\nwhere they are.",
      "_offset": 684,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Gennai must know something!",
      "_offset": 763,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Let's go look for Gennai,\neveryone!",
      "_offset": 791,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We don't know where he is, either.\nHow would we even look for him?",
      "_offset": 827,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I'm tired of this. I wanna go home\nright noooooow!",
      "_offset": 894,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "But Takeru...",
      "_offset": 945,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I don't want him to start\ncrying...we're leaving to go look\nfor Taichi, after all.",
      "_offset": 959,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "we're leaving to go look for\nTaichi, after all.",
      "_offset": 1042,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Take care, Tokomon.",
      "_offset": 1090,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "*yawn*? Mm...",
      "_offset": 1110,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "It's impossible. We don't have\nenough clues.",
      "_offset": 1124,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I'm sure we'll figure out both\nTaichi's location and the secrets\nof the Crests.",
      "_offset": 1169,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "I don't know, it doesn't seem very\nlikely. I don't want to get\neveryone's hopes up.",
      "_offset": 1249,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I understand. In that case, I\ndon't mind going with only\nTentomon.",
      "_offset": 1333,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Koushirou...",
      "_offset": 1400,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Koushirou...",
      "_offset": 1413,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Well, we can't stop you.",
      "_offset": 1426,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I'm sure we'll find Gennai!",
      "_offset": 1451,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I'll be goin' with him. Don't pay\nus any mind.",
      "_offset": 1479,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Okay, everyone, take care...",
      "_offset": 1526,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "All right, see you later.",
      "_offset": 1555,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Jouuuuuuu! Find a ton of food,\nokay?",
      "_offset": 1581,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay! You shouldn't hang around\ndoing nothing either, Mimi.",
      "_offset": 1618,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Hey, Takeru. Let's go, too.",
      "_offset": 1678,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Jou and Gomamon are out late.",
      "_offset": 1710,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "I wonder if Jou got lost...",
      "_offset": 1740,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Takeru, Mimi, get some sleep. I'll\ntake my turn at watch.",
      "_offset": 1768,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Don't worry about Jou. I'm sure\nhe'll find a way back, somehow.",
      "_offset": 1830,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Mimi, don't be selfish.",
      "_offset": 1894,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "I'm sick of this! It's nothing but\nwalking through the desert!",
      "_offset": 1918,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "But we were just at an oasis...",
      "_offset": 1981,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I wanna go back to the oasis!",
      "_offset": 2013,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Then what are you gonna do? Live\nat the oasis?",
      "_offset": 2043,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "I'll figure that out later! I'm\ngoing back!",
      "_offset": 2090,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Mimiiii! Don't leave me behind!",
      "_offset": 2134,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Looks like it's just us now.",
      "_offset": 2166,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Let's go, Takeru. We'll probably\nget out of the desert if we keep\ngoing.",
      "_offset": 2195,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Heeeeeeeey! Where are you guys?",
      "_offset": 2272,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Heeeeeeeey! I wonder where\neveryone went...",
      "_offset": 2304,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Hm? What's this? The Digivice is\nreacting to something.",
      "_offset": 2348,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "It's coming from that direction.\nThe others must be over there!",
      "_offset": 2404,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Let's head to wherever it's coming\nfrom!",
      "_offset": 2468,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "The reaction's getting stronger!\nWe're close!",
      "_offset": 2509,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2555,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It's Tokomon! Hang in there,\nTokomon! Are you okay?",
      "_offset": 2568,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Taichi? Agumon? You're\naliiiiiiiive!",
      "_offset": 2620,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Yeah, of course!",
      "_offset": 2657,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Did you get beaten up by an enemy\nDigimon, Tokomon?",
      "_offset": 2674,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "No, I didn't. I'm just tired and\nhungry...",
      "_offset": 2726,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Where's Takeru? Where are the\nothers?",
      "_offset": 2769,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Takeru's with PicoDevimon.",
      "_offset": 2807,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "PicoDevimon? Who's that?",
      "_offset": 2834,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "PicoDevimon is, uh...",
      "_offset": 2859,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Take it from the top. Tell us what\nhappened to the others.",
      "_offset": 2881,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 2940,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Hey, Yamato. I wonder where\neveryone went?",
      "_offset": 2948,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Don't worry. We can get by without\nthem.",
      "_offset": 2991,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Doesn't look like we have any more\nenemies like Devimon and Etemon.",
      "_offset": 3032,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Yamato, we should go back and look\nfor Taichi.",
      "_offset": 3100,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Give up on that!",
      "_offset": 3147,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "But...*waaaaaah*",
      "_offset": 3164,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "I'm sorry, don't cry! I'm sure\nTaichi and Agumon are doing okay\nsomewhere.",
      "_offset": 3181,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Taichi's alive, right?",
      "_offset": 3256,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Yeah. We'll see him again\nsometime.",
      "_offset": 3279,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Huh...?",
      "_offset": 3315,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Could it be...an amusement park?!",
      "_offset": 3323,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I'll go check it out.",
      "_offset": 3361,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Okay, I'll wait here.",
      "_offset": 3383,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Good boy, Takeru!",
      "_offset": 3405,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "But come back quickly, okay?",
      "_offset": 3423,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Yeah, just wait here. It'll just\nbe a few hours. I'll be back soon.",
      "_offset": 3452,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Stay strong and protect Takeru,\nTokomon!",
      "_offset": 3520,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 3561,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Yamato...Yamato! He was only\nsupposed to be taking a quick\nlook...",
      "_offset": 3567,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "He said he'd be back soon!\nWaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3634,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Don't cry, Takeru...",
      "_offset": 3675,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Why are you crying?",
      "_offset": 3696,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "My brother hasn't come back.",
      "_offset": 3716,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Huuuuh! That's bad! Okay, I'll go\nlook for him. What's his name?",
      "_offset": 3745,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Yamato.",
      "_offset": 3810,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "All right, just a minute.",
      "_offset": 3818,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting!",
      "_offset": 3844,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "D-did you find Yamato?",
      "_offset": 3871,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "I found him, but he gave me a\nmessage.",
      "_offset": 3894,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "What...?",
      "_offset": 3933,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Yamato said he doesn't want to see\nyou again.",
      "_offset": 3942,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "He said he really, really hates\nyou and doesn't want to be your\nbrother anymore.",
      "_offset": 3988,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "N-No way...",
      "_offset": 4069,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Takeru, don't cry...",
      "_offset": 4081,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Oh, and he also said that he hates\nyou 'cause you're a crybaby.",
      "_offset": 4102,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "*sob* Well, I hate Yamato too!\n*sob*",
      "_offset": 4166,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Yamato wouldn't say anything like\nthat! Don't lie to Takeru!",
      "_offset": 4203,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Lie? If you've got evidence I'm\nlying, show it to me!",
      "_offset": 4264,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "I can't do that, but...",
      "_offset": 4318,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Saying that kind of thing's called\nslander. You can go to court over\nthat. Wanna do it?",
      "_offset": 4342,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Hmmmmmph!",
      "_offset": 4430,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 4440,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "What are you doing, Tokomon?!",
      "_offset": 4455,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Don't blame Tokomon, Takeru. He's\njust jealous of my relationship\nwith you.",
      "_offset": 4485,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Tokomon, apologize to PicoDevimon!",
      "_offset": 4561,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "No, I won't!",
      "_offset": 4596,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Apologize!",
      "_offset": 4609,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "No way! If you want me to\napologize, then I'm out of here!",
      "_offset": 4620,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Really? Okay, then leave!",
      "_offset": 4679,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Do you really want me to leave?",
      "_offset": 4705,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Do you really want me to leave?",
      "_offset": 4737,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Yeah, go ahead! Oh yeah, there\naren't any more enemies around, so\nI don't need these, either!",
      "_offset": 4769,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "And Takeru threw away the Tag and\nDigivice.",
      "_offset": 4863,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4907,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4919,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Let's go, PicoDevimon!",
      "_offset": 4931,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Heh heh heh...",
      "_offset": 4954,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "And that's why you're alone.",
      "_offset": 4969,
      "_length": 28,
