      "index": 139,
      "english": "I don't know what PicoDevimon told\nyou, but Yamato doesn't hate you.",
      "_offset": 5994,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "He started hating me because I was\nonly worrying about you!",
